      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The gibtas attempts to Trip the target of its Bouncing Slam, then makes a jaws Strike against the target. The Trip and Strike both count against the gibtas's multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after both attacks."
      ],
